  lead:"A brush fire, a trick of the light, a made-up story, a gas leak and a heat vision have each been closed by a document. What is left is not a name for the thing on that hillside — it is a fact about it: it was burning and it was using nothing up. Burning is fuel being turned into something else, so every natural version of it says there should be ash. The survey found none, on ground where ash sits in the cracks for years, next to a bush that flowered the following year.",
